    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Game concept\u3011</h2>There is a faraway place in the universe.<br>Control a glowing blue ball and aim to clear all stages.<br>A 3D action ball game wandering in the beautiful outer space.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010About the game\u3011</h2>\u30fbRoll the ball smoothly to reach the goal. <br>\u30fbBall falls outside the floor and the game is over.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Method of operation\u3011</h2>\u30fbIt's easy to control\u2014simply maneuver the joystick.<br>\u30fbThe left stick rolls the ball.<br>\u30fbThe right stick changes the angle.<br><br>Let's operate the ball well and aim for the goal!<br>Roll,roll,roll,roll.........................",
